r</span></header><nav class="ugc2-view-list"><button type="button" class=""><span>Developer Graph</span><kbd>gd</kbd></button></nav></section><footer class="ugc2-user"><span>A</span><strong>Arthur</strong><em>Pro</em></footer></aside><section class="ugc2-main"><header class="ugc2-topbar"><div class="ugc2-breadcrumb"><strong>UGC Studio</strong><span>/</span><span>Protein Bar Ads</span><span>/</span><em>Persona Atlas</em></div><div class="ugc2-top-actions"><span class="ugc2-status">Auto-saved just now</span><button type="button">Preview</button><button type="button">Share</button><button type="button" class="dark">Export</button></div></header><div class="ugc2-workbench"><section class="ugc2-content"><header class="ugc2-view-toolbar"><div><p>gp / fitness snack / creative search graph</p><h1>Persona Atlas</h1></div><div class="ugc2-toolbar-actions"><button type="button">Filter</button><button type="button">Sort</button><button type="button">Group</button><button type="button">More</button></div></header><section class="ugc2-view-stage" aria-label="Persona Atlas"><div class="ugc2-atlas-layout"><section class="ugc2-persona-grid"><button type="button" class="ugc2-persona-card selected"><div class="ugc2-portrait" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5c9bb, #dbe8cf);"><span>2 clips</span><strong>SG</strong></div><div class="ugc2-card-body"><div class="ugc2-card-title"><strong>Seoul Gym Diary</strong><span class="ugc2-pill good">promising</span></div><p>Korean beauty / K-pop-idol-adjacent fitness UGC</p><dl class="ugc2-compact-dl"><dt>Voice</dt><dd>quiet confidence, short clauses, understated humor</dd><dt>Accent</dt><dd>light Korean-accented English</dd><dt>Niche</dt><dd>low-friction fitness habits for people who hate supplement culture</dd></dl><footer><span>1 branches</span><span>4 followers / 3 conversion</span></footer></div></button><button type="button" class="ugc2-persona-card"><div class="ugc2-portrait" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d7e4ff, #f5d9a8);"><span>1 clips</span><strong>DR</strong></div><div class="ugc2-card-body"><div class="ugc2-card-title"><strong>Deadpan Runner</strong><span class="ugc2-pill warning">draft</span></div><p>deadpan fitness micro-vlog</p><dl class="ugc2-compact-dl"><dt>Voice</dt><dd>dry, clipped, practical</dd><dt>Accent</dt><dd>neutral English</dd><dt>Niche</dt><dd>practical snacks for runners and commuters</dd></dl><footer><span>1 branches</span><span>5 authority / 2 conversion</span></footer></div></button></section><section class="ugc2-agent-log"><h2>Agent critique</h2><p>Best current persona lane.</p><p>Needs more specific gestures and less generic UGC smile.</p><p>Good contrast lane, but not the main visual direction.</p><button type="button">Generate 12 persona directions</button></section></div></section></section><aside class="ugc2-inspector" aria-label="Inspector"><header><div><p>Inspector</p><h2>Persona Atlas</h2></div><nav><button type="button" class="active">Creative</button><button type="button" class="">JSON</button></nav></header><section class="ugc2-inspector-card"><h3>Product brief</h3><p>Clean Fuel Protein Bar / High-protein snack bar with low sugar and no sugar alcohols.</p><div class="ugc2-score"><span>CTA posts</span><div><i style="width: 50%;"></i></div><strong>50</strong></div><div class="ugc2-score"><span>Profile posts</span><div><i style="width: 50%;"></i></div><strong>50</strong></div></section><section class="ugc2-inspector-card"><h3>Selected persona</h3><dl class="ugc2-compact-dl"><dt>Name</dt><dd>Seoul Gym Diary</dd><dt>Lane</dt><dd>Korean beauty / K-pop-idol-adjacent fitness UGC</dd><dt>Energy</dt><dd>68%</dd><dt>Cadence</dt><dd>4 followers / 3 conversion</dd></dl></section><section class="ugc2-inspector-card"><h3>Selected candidate</h3><p>I needed a snack that did not feel like homework.</p><div class="ugc2-score"><span>Overall</span><div><i style="width: 86%;"></i></div><strong>86</strong></div><div class="ugc2-score"><span>Persona fit</span><div><i style="width: 91%;"></i></div><strong>91</strong></div></section><section class="ugc2-inspector-card"><h3>Branch decision</h3><p>Start broad before deciding on persona lane.</p><button type="button">Fork this snapshot</button></section><section class="ugc2-inspector-card"><h3>Reference remix</h3><p>Use a public profile as a research target for abstract timing/profile mechanics, then swap in a synthetic persona, voice, hooks, captions, and product.</p><button type="button">Open clean-room rules</button></section></aside></div><section class="ugc2-command-bar" aria-label="Agent command bar"><button type="button">+</button><textarea aria-label="Agent instruction"></textarea><div class="ugc2-command-chips"><button type="button">2 selected sets</button><button type="button">Attach product page</button><button type="button">Agent settings</button></div><button type="button" class="run">Run</button></section></section></main>"`;
